        "routeSummary": "Tiger Kingdom & Dolphin Show",
        "overviewText": "If southern Thailand is on your travel list, this **Phuket & Krabi tour package** brings together everything travelers love about the region — turquoise waters, island hopping, tropical jungles, lively beach towns, and just the right amount of free time. Planned over 7 days and 6 nights, this itinerary lets you explore two of Thailand’s most popular destinations without rushing through them.\n\nIdeal for couples, families, and friends traveling from India, this [Thailand tour package](https://indiatour.live/tours/amazing-thailand-vacation) focuses on comfort, curated experiences, and smooth logistics, so you can simply enjoy the journey.\n\n\n### How Your Phuket & Krabi Trip Unfolds\n### \n#### Krabi – Where the Trip Slows Down (3 Nights)\n#### \nYour journey begins in [Krabi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/krabi), a destination known for its dramatic limestone cliffs, calm beaches, and island-studded coastline. This part of the trip is all about natural beauty and easy-paced exploration.\n\nDuring your stay in Krabi, you’ll experience:\n\n- A **7 Island Tour by traditional long-tail boat**, taking you around some of Krabi’s most scenic islands, beaches, and snorkeling spots\n- A guided **Krabi Jungle Tour**, where lush forests, waterfalls, and viewpoints show you a different side of southern Thailand\n- Plenty of time to enjoy Krabi’s relaxed beaches and laid-back vibe\n\nKrabi is perfect for easing into your Thailand holiday — scenic, peaceful, and beautifully tropical.\n\n\n#### Phuket – Energy, Islands & Experiences (3 Nights)\n#### \nFrom Krabi, you head to [Phuket](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phuket), Thailand’s most famous island destination. Phuket adds energy to the trip with its mix of beaches, culture, and unique attractions.\n\nHere’s what your Phuket stay includes:\n\n- A **[Phi Phi Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phi-phi-island) tour by speedboat**, covering iconic locations like Maya Bay and [Bamboo Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bamboo-island), with time for swimming and snorkeling\n- A guided **Phuket city tour**, introducing you to local landmarks, viewpoints, and cultural highlights\n- Visits to **[Tiger Kingdom](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tiger-kingdom)** and an entertaining **[Dolphin Show](https://indiatour.live/attractions/dolphine-show-phuket)**, making this part of the trip especially enjoyable for families and first-time visitors\n- Leisure time to relax on the beach, explore local markets, or simply slow down and enjoy the island\n\nPhuket gives you a balance of guided sightseeing and personal exploration.\n\n\n### Experiences That Make This Phuket & Krabi Package Special\n### \nInstead of packing every day with activities, this Phuket and Krabi tour package focuses on experiences that truly define a Thailand holiday:\n\n- Island hopping across **Phi Phi Islands and Krabi’s island clusters**\n- Swimming and snorkeling in crystal-clear waters\n- Exploring tropical jungles and scenic viewpoints\n- Enjoying wildlife attractions unique to Phuket\n- Relaxed days to explore beaches and local cafés at your own pace\n\nThis balance makes the trip enjoyable for both active travelers and those who prefer a slower holiday.\n\n\n### Comfort, Stays & Transfers — All Sorted\n### \nTravel comfort is a key part of this Thailand tour package:\n\n- **3 nights in Krabi** at well-located hotels close to beaches and attractions\n- **3 nights in Phuket** in modern properties with easy access to sightseeing\n- **Daily breakfast** included throughout the trip\n- **Seamless transfers**, including airport pick-up and drop and Krabi–Phuket intercity travel\n\nWith logistics taken care of, you’re free to focus on enjoying Thailand.\n\n\n\n### Who Should Choose This Phuket & Krabi Tour Package\n### \nThis itinerary works especially well for:\n\n- Couples planning a tropical getaway or honeymoon\n- Families looking for a mix of nature, sightseeing, and fun experiences\n- Friends wanting island adventures with relaxed downtime\n- First-time travelers to Thailand from India who want a well-planned, stress-free trip\n\nThe pace and experiences are designed to suit a wide range of travelers.\n\n\n### Why This Phuket & Krabi Tour Works So Well\n### \n- Covers two of Thailand’s most loved destinations in one trip\n- Blends islands, jungle adventures, wildlife, and leisure days\n- Comfortable stays, curated sightseeing, and smooth transfers included\n- Flexible for different group sizes, making it easy to plan",
