      "routeSummary": "with Phuket, Krabi & Ko Samui",
      "overviewText": "The **7 days / 6 nights Thailand Full Moon Party Tour Package** is designed for travellers who want to experience Thailand’s famous island life along with its legendary nightlife. Covering **[Phuket](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phuket), Krabi, and [Koh Samui](https://indiatour.live/attractions/koh-samui)**, this group-focused trip blends island hopping, beach time, nightlife, and the iconic **Full Moon Party at [Koh Phangan](https://indiatour.live/attractions/koh-phangan)**.\n\nPerfect for friends and young travellers, the package includes comfortable stays, airport and inter-island transfers, select meals, sightseeing, and guided support—so you can enjoy the party vibe and island adventures without worrying about logistics.\n\n\n\n### **Destinations & What You Experience**\n### \n#### **Phuket**\n#### \nPhuket sets the tone for the trip with its lively beaches and nightlife. You’ll experience the island’s energetic side, including popular nightlife zones like **[Bangla Walking Street](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bangla-walking-street)**, along with time to relax, explore beaches, or enjoy optional water activities.\n\n#### **Krabi**\n\n[Krabi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/krabi) adds scenic beauty and island exploration to the journey. The region is known for its limestone cliffs, calm waters, and island-hopping experiences. Beach time and boat tours make this a relaxed yet adventurous stop.\n\n#### **Koh Samui & Koh Phangan**\n\nKoh Samui offers a tropical island atmosphere with beach clubs, fire shows, and laid-back party scenes. From here, you head to **Koh Phangan** for the world-famous **Full Moon Party**, where music, neon lights, and beachfront celebrations create an unforgettable night.\n\n\n### **Experiences Included in the Package**\n### \n- Entry to the **[Full Moon Party](https://indiatour.live/attractions/full-moon-party-thailand) at Koh Phangan**\n- [Phi Phi Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phi-phi-island) Tour by Speedboat (Maya Bay & Bamboo Island)\n- 4 Island Tour in Krabi by Long Tail Boat (Hong, [Chicken](https://indiatour.live/attractions/chicken-island-koh-gai), Tup & [Poda Islands](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ko-poda-island))\n- Beach clubs, fire shows, and nightlife experiences in Koh Samui\n- Phuket nightlife exploration, including Bangla Walking Street\n- Leisure time for beaches and self-exploration\n\n\n### **Accommodation & Travel Comfort**\n### \n- **Total Nights:** 6 nights across Phuket, Krabi, and Koh Samui\n- **Phuket:** 2 nights in modern hotels with easy access to nightlife\n- **Krabi:** 2 nights near beaches and island tour points\n- **Koh Samui:** 2 nights in properties close to beaches and party areas\n- **Meals Included:** 6 breakfasts & 2 local lunches\n- **Transfers:**\n    - Airport pickups and drops\n    - Inter-island ferry transfers\n    - Local transfers for sightseeing and parties\n\n\n### **Who This Thailand Full Moon Party Package Is Ideal For**\n### \n- Groups of friends travelling together\n- Young travellers looking for nightlife and island adventures\n- Party lovers who also want sightseeing and beach time\n\nThis package works best for **group travel** and can be planned for different group sizes depending on availability and dates.\n\n### **Why Choose This Full Moon Party Tour Package**\n### \n- Covers Thailand’s most popular party and island destinations\n- Includes the iconic Full Moon Party experience\n- Balanced mix of nightlife, island hopping, and leisure\n- Hassle-free planning with stays, transfers, and key experiences included",
