      "overviewText": "Discover the beauty of southern Thailand with our **Scenic Phuket & Krabi Tour Package**. Over 5 days and 4 nights, explore Krabi’s stunning islands, enjoy the iconic **[Phi Phi Island Tour](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phi-phi-island)**, and experience Phuket’s cultural highlights with a **[Free Phuket City Tour](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phuket)**.\n\nIdeal for couples, families, and groups, this all-inclusive package includes **comfortable stays, seamless transfers, daily breakfast**, and curated sightseeing for a relaxing and memorable vacation.\n\n### Why Travelers Love the Scenic Phuket & Krabi Tour Package\n### \n- **All-Inclusive Convenience:** Airport pickups, transfers, stays, sightseeing, and meals are included.\n- **Flexible Group Options:** Packages available for 2, 4, or 6 travelers.\n- **Adventure & Relaxation:** Snorkel, island-hop, explore the city, and enjoy leisure time on pristine beaches.\n- **Curated Itinerary:** Balanced schedule combining adventure, sightseeing, and relaxation for a stress-free holiday.\n\n\n### Top Experiences on This Phuket & Krabi Trip\n### \n- **4 Island Tour in [Krabi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/krabi) by Long Tail Boat:** Explore [Hong Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hong-island), Chicken Island, Tup Island, and [Poda Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ko-poda-island) with swimming, snorkeling, and scenic views.\n- **Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat:** Visit Maya Bay and [Bamboo Island](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bamboo-island), swim in crystal-clear waters, and admire the stunning landscapes.\n- **Phuket City Tour:** Free city tour included to explore local culture, markets, and viewpoints.\n- **Leisure Time:** Relax on [Phuket and Krabi’s](https://indiatour.live/tours/scenic-phuket-and-krabi) beaches or explore local attractions at your own pace.\n\n\n### Accommodation & Comfort\n### \nEnjoy a comfortable stay throughout the trip:\n\n- **Krabi:** 2 nights in hotels near beaches and attractions\n- **Phuket:** 2 nights in carefully selected properties with modern amenities\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Included to energize your mornings\n- **Seamless Transfers:** Airport pickups, drops, and [Krabi-Phuket](https://indiatour.live/tours/phuket-tour-package) transfers included",
